at/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe1%2F3b%2Fc4576aa14f7f879c8f83e8b05046%2Fap26307590155292.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2706x1522+0+141/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe1%2F3b%2Fc4576aa14f7f879c8f83e8b05046%2Fap26307590155292.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2706x1522+0+141/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe1%2F3b%2Fc4576aa14f7f879c8f83e8b05046%2Fap26307590155292.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2706x1522+0+141/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe1%2F3b%2Fc4576aa14f7f879c8f83e8b05046%2Fap26307590155292.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2706x1522+0+141/resize/1100/quality/50/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe1%2F3b%2Fc4576aa14f7f879c8f83e8b05046%2Fap26307590155292.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2706x1522+0+141/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fe1%2F3b%2Fc4576aa14f7f879c8f83e8b05046%2Fap26307590155292.jpg" class="img" alt="Comedian and actor Russell Brand leaves Southwark Crown Court in London, Tuesday, Nov. 3, 2026." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Comedian and actor Russell Brand leaves Southwark Crown Court in London, Tuesday, Nov. 3, 2026.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Alastair Grant/AP                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;button class="toggle-caption" aria-label=""&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;abbr title="Toggle Caption" class="toggle-caption__info"&gt;i&lt;/abbr&gt;              &lt;/button&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;ol class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Comedian Russell Brand faces a "significant" prison sentence as a London court is &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/08/nx-s1-6033957/russell-brand-learn-sentence-found-guilty-rape-sexual-assault" target="_blank"&gt;set to announce his punishment&lt;/a&gt; today after a jury convicted him on three counts of sexual assault and one count of rape. Brand has denied all charges.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The U.S. homeless population &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/07/nx-s1-6033491/homelessness-in-the-u-s-saw-its-largest-drop-in-more-than-a-decade-last-year" target="_blank"&gt;decreased by more than 6%&lt;/a&gt; in 2025, according to the Department of Housing and Urban Development. This marks the second consecutive year of decline.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pope Leo XIV arrived in South America on Friday for a 12-day trip across three countries. This will be his longest and &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/11/06/nx-s1-6026702/pope-leo-begins-12-day-3-country-tour-after-cancer-surgery" target="_blank"&gt;most significant journey to date&lt;/a&gt;, as well as his first major overseas visit since undergoing lung cancer surgery.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This newsletter was edited by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/people/859721331/suzanne-nuyen"target="_blank"   &gt;&lt;em&gt;Suzanne Nuyen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
